flowchart TB
  User["Operator<br/>Uses Nova through trusted interfaces"]
  Host["Windows Host<br/>Runs the desktop, WSL2, and native integrations"]
  Tail["Tailscale<br/>Provides private access between trusted devices"]
  WSL["WSL2 Ubuntu Environment<br/>Hosts Nova's Linux runtime and engineering workspace"]
  Docker["Container Platform / Docker Service Layer<br/>Runs and isolates Nova's self-hosted workloads"]

  User --> Host
  Host --> Tail
  Host --> WSL
  WSL --> Docker

  CoreOps["Core Operations<br/>Runs home automation, media, VPN, and credential workflows"]
